SUMMARY:PRS Database: rule starts for the East Midlands (draft)
DESCRIPTION:PRS Database dates for the East Midlands. Rule starts: 15 Febru
 ary 2027. Register by: 14 May 2027.\n\nThe start date is in the draft Priv
 ate Rented Sector Database Regulations 2026. The register-by date comes fr
 om Government guidance on the Housing Hub. We last checked both on 3 Octob
 er 2026. The regulations were still draft then\, so the dates could change
 .\n\nCheck before you rely on these dates.\nGuide: https://innovatedigi.gi
